        <mxCell id="n1" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacing=8;fontSize=10;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="Notes:&lt;br&gt;1. All human actors authenticate through UC-01 (REQ-015, NFR-08).&lt;br&gt;2. UC-09 is triggered by the system when a Critical incident is open for 60 minutes (BRU-002) and extends UC-03.&lt;br&gt;3. UC-04 to UC-07 are reached by the Engineer through UC-03 (include/extend).&lt;br&gt;4. Team Lead may also perform Engineer use cases [Assumed]." vertex="1">
